# Shell scripts MUST use LF line endings.
#
# Rationale: these scripts run under bash on the Linux deploy host. A deploy once
# failed at `set -euo pipefail` because `git archive` had exported the file with
# CRLF (the trailing \r turned `pipefail` into an invalid option). Forcing eol=lf
# guarantees `git archive`/checkout produce LF regardless of the committer's OS
# (autocrlf). Scoped to *.sh only to avoid renormalizing unrelated files.
*.sh text eol=lf
